@startuml
allowmixing
title Plugin contracts, provider specialization and extension points
hide empty members
left to right direction
package "Core plugin API" {
  class BeetsPluginMeta <<metaclass>>
  class BeetsPlugin {
    commands()
    register_listener(event, func)
    early_import_stages
    import_stages
    template_funcs
    template_fields
  }
  abstract class MetadataSourcePlugin {
    album_for_id(id)
    track_for_id(id)
  }
  abstract class "SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin<R>" as SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin {
    get_search_query_with_filters(...)
    get_search_response(params)
  }
  class SearchParams <<namedtuple>>
}
class "beets.ui.Subcommand" as Subcommand <<reference>>
class "beetsplug.musicbrainz.MusicBrainzPlugin" as MusicBrainz
class "beetsplug.spotify.SpotifyPlugin" as Spotify
class "beetsplug.chroma.AcoustidPlugin" as Acoustid
class "beetsplug.tidal.TidalPlugin" as Tidal
component "beets.plugins\nload_plugins / find_plugins / send" as Registry <<module>>
component "Importer coroutine stages" as Stages
component "Metadata search orchestration" as Search
BeetsPlugin ..> BeetsPluginMeta : metaclass
MetadataSourcePlugin --|> BeetsPlugin
SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin --|> MetadataSourcePlugin
MusicBrainz --|> SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin
Spotify --|> SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin
Acoustid --|> MetadataSourcePlugin
Tidal --|> MetadataSourcePlugin
SearchApiMetadataSourcePlugin ..> SearchParams : creates / passes to hook
BeetsPlugin ..> Subcommand : commands() returns
Registry --> "0..*" BeetsPlugin : _instances / listeners
BeetsPlugin ..> Registry : register listener
Stages ..> Registry : send events / request stage callbacks
Search ..> Registry : find metadata providers
Search ..> MetadataSourcePlugin : execute provider hooks
note bottom of Registry
The registry and event dispatcher are module functions,
not an additional PluginManager class.
beets.events declares event names and payload schemas.
end note
@enduml
